  "notes": "USAGE: スピーチ is commonly used for speeches at events like weddings, ceremonies, and competitions.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・スピーチをする (to give a speech)\n・スピーチを{頼|たの}む (to ask someone to give a speech)\n・スピーチコンテスト (speech contest)\n・{乾杯|かんぱい}のスピーチ (toast speech)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n・{演説|えんぜつ} (public speech, usually political)\n・{挨拶|あいさつ} (greeting speech, remarks)\n・{講演|こうえん} (lecture)\n・{発表|はっぴょう} (presentation)",
